{
  "_doc": "THE data of the Cloud Tools sections: Models (small / medium / retrieval, each as Table, Grid, Details or Macro), the AI chat model picker (chat=true rows only, grouped by macro) and Apps (what the models build). One row per model. Sizes are GB, approximate. disk_gb_fp16 is the raw fp16/bf16 weights; every ram_gb_* figure is weights at that precision plus the overhead below. Optional per model: task (specific task), openrouter_id (the OpenRouter id; a model without one is not offered on the OpenRouter backend). locations are the runtimes the Store manages (kind device = this phone, ollama = a fleet host with the Ollama API). Optional per app step: backend (local | openrouter; default local when the app is phone-capable, else openrouter). Read by data/ModelsData.kt; test/test-tools-app.sh holds its shape.",
  "overhead_pct": 20,
  "overhead_note": "RAM figures assume about 20% overhead on top of the weights (KV cache, inference engine, activations).",
  "phone_budget_gb_q4": 6.0,
  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "phone",
      "label": "This phone",
      "kind": "device"
    },
    {
      "id": "ollama",
      "label": "Fleet Ollama",
      "kind": "ollama",
      "url": "http://ollama.mesh.diegonmarcos.com"
    }
  ],
  "quant_tags": {
    "4": "q4_K_M",
    "8": "q8_0",
    "16": "fp16"
  },
  "quant_tags_note": "The tag suffix a fleet Ollama pull asks for at 4, 8 and 16 bits.",
  "phone_each_gb_q4": 2.5,
  "phone_budget_note": "An app is phone-capable when the distinct models of its pipeline total at most phone_budget_gb_q4 of RAM at 4-bit (the largest alternative of a step counts) and no single model needs more than phone_each_gb_q4. A step with alternatives = true runs ONE of its models; a step with escalation = true runs only when the earlier step is not enough; a step with a note and no models is not a model (a deeplink).",
  "tiers": {
    "small": {
      "label": "Small",
      "hint": "Up to 4B parameters"
    },
    "medium": {
      "label": "Medium",
      "hint": "7B to 32B parameters"
    }
  },
